<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
  The third entry: four cells across, two tall, and horizontal-only — the six prayers across, and a
  full-width line for the ayat underneath.

  The dp figures are taken from the two entries that already exist rather than from the cell-size
  formula: the wide entry proves 250dp is four columns on this grid and the vertical entry proves
  110dp is two rows. Deriving them instead ((73n-16) x (118m-16)) produced a panel the launcher
  offered as 4x4, because a cell is not that tall on every device — the sizes here are the ones the
  app has actually been measured against.

  minResizeWidth and minResizeHeight repeat that 4x2, which is what "cannot be squeezed smaller"
  means: the quote line is the whole point of this entry and it needs the width to say anything.
  Someone who wants a smaller prayer panel already has the other two entries.

  It resizes in both directions, from that floor up to roughly 4x4 (maxResizeHeight 460dp). That
  number is measured, not derived: a placed 4x2 reports ~219dp on the reference device, so a row is
  ~110dp and four of them are ~440dp. Height is not decoration here — the ayat block takes the
  leftover space and the provider budgets its line counts from it, so a reader who wants the whole
  ayah instead of an opening line drags the panel taller and gets it.

  The floor cannot be expressed exactly in dp on every grid, so the provider does not rely on it:
  squeezed below what a quote needs, it hides the ayat block and its hairline rather than clipping
  text, the same way the base drops the city header on a short panel.

  Everything else — the update period, the boundary alarm, the glass panel — is
  PrayerTimesWidgetProvider's, shared with the two schedule-only entries.
-->
<appwidget-provider xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
  android:description="@string/widget_prayer_ayat_description"
  android:initialLayout="@layout/widget_prayer_times_ayat"
  android:maxResizeWidth="500dp"
  android:maxResizeHeight="460dp"
  android:minWidth="250dp"
  android:minHeight="110dp"
  android:minResizeWidth="250dp"
  android:minResizeHeight="110dp"
  android:previewLayout="@layout/widget_prayer_times_ayat_preview"
  android:resizeMode="horizontal|vertical"
  android:targetCellWidth="4"
  android:targetCellHeight="2"
  android:updatePeriodMillis="1800000"
  android:widgetCategory="home_screen" />
